        "heading": {
          "zh": "產品介紹",
          "en": "Products"
        },
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "label": {
              "zh": "雲芝糖肽精華（PSP）",
              "en": "Yunzhi PSP Essence (PSP)"
            },
            "text": {
              "zh": "是從Cov-1品種的深層菌絲體提取的多糖肽聚合體。研究表明多糖肽可以增强人體免疫功能，同時能够調控異細胞功能，通過激活免疫效應細胞從而促使異細胞的凋謝。",
              "en": "is a polysaccharide-peptide complex extracted from the deep-layer mycelium of the Cov-1 strain. Research indicates that polysaccharide peptides can strengthen the body's immune function while regulating abnormal cell activity, promoting apoptosis of abnormal cells by activating immune effector cells."
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "根據國家藥品標準，雲芝糖肽的含量不得低於49.5%（多糖不得低於38%，蛋白肽含量不得低於11.5%），康草堂產品的「有效成份」含量高達90%以上。可能是香港唯一達到「國家藥品監督管理局」標準的雲芝糖肽 PSP。濃度及活性含量更高於國家標準80%，深受中西醫信賴。",
              "en": "According to national drug standards, Yunzhi PSP content must not be less than 49.5% (polysaccharides ≥38%, protein peptides ≥11.5%). <strong>Wonder Herb's active ingredient content exceeds 90%</strong>. It is possibly the only Yunzhi PSP in Hong Kong meeting the 'National Medical Products Administration' standard, with potency 80% higher than national requirements, trusted by TCM and Western medicine practitioners."
            }
          }
        ],
        "variant": "group"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text-block",
      "wrap": {
        "tag": "div",
        "section": "product-details-card",
        "id": "detailedInfo",
        "container": false
      },
      "fields": {
        "heading": {
          "zh": "產品功效及特性",
          "en": "Key Benefits & Features"
        },
        "bullets": [
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "配合傳統治療 (化療、電療、標靶、免疫治療)及於手術前後服用",
              "en": "Taken alongside conventional treatment (chemotherapy, radiotherapy, targeted therapy, immunotherapy) and before and after surgery"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "減低療程不適，例如疲勞，胃口不佳，痛楚，失眠，噁心，嘔吐等",
              "en": "Eases treatment discomfort such as fatigue, poor appetite, pain, insomnia, nausea and vomiting"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "減低復發機會",
              "en": "Reduces the chance of recurrence"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "為頑症病人、抵抗力低、或頑症家族史人仕提升自身免疫力",
              "en": "Raises the body's own immunity for cancer patients, people with low resistance, and those with a family history of cancer"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "zh": "活性含量高出國家藥品標準近一倍",
              "en": "Active content nearly double the national drug standard"
            }
          }
        ],
        "variant": "group",
        "spacedHeading": true
      }
